      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2013 The Authors Pain Practice © 2013 World Institute of Pain.",
        "AbstractText": "There is a need for interventional pain management in the developing world; however, there are many barriers to the introduction of interventional pain therapies. This brief report describes one approach to the introduction of interventional pain medicine to a Nigerian teaching hospital. Although many barriers exist, interventional pain medicine can be brought to the developing world, as demonstrated in this case series."
      },
